# Vetcure — Farmer & Doctor Portal (Demo)

This is a single-file client-side demo implementing the requested features for farmers and doctors. It is a static demo that stores data in the browser `localStorage`.

Files:
- [index.html](index.html) — main single-page application
- [styles.css](styles.css) — styles
- [script.js](script.js) — client logic (registration, complaints, payments, doctor actions)

How to run:
1. Open `index.html` in a browser.
2. Register as a `farmer` or `doctor` using the Register form.
3. Login, post complaints (farmers), respond to complaints and post news (doctors), and simulate payments.

Notes:
- This is a demo only; no backend or real payment gateways.
- Data persists in the browser used; clear browser localStorage to reset.
